  "result_tail": "rd, each asserted to finish under a second (the whole test took about 43 ms).\n\n## semver-mini\n\nImplemented `compare` in `src/semver.mjs`; the tests are untouched and I did not look for the held-out cases. Validation uses the semver.org grammar. Numeric parts are compared as digit strings, so numbers beyond 2^53 compare exactly. A non-string argument throws `TypeError` before validity is checked, even when the other argument is an invalid version.\n\nAn extra spot-check of edge cases outside the test file was blocked by the session's permissions, so those rest on the grammar rather than on a run.",
